scriptdeployment.custscript_pd_invoice_terms_condition_ds:
1) All bills are due and payable to the address above mentioned.&lt;br/&gt;
2) All claims and damages are to be made within 30 days.&lt;br/&gt;
3) Sales includes shipping charges unless stated otherwise.&lt;br/&gt;
4) In case of EXCHANGE, the Customer undertakes to return the Core Unit in 30 calendar days
(unless otehrwise on quotation) from the date of delivery the Exchange Unit. After 30 days,
Exchagne Fees will be applied in additon to all costs inccured to the Exchange Transaction, including full and final costs of
the Core's re-certification, evaluation fees, scrap fees, all transportation costs, customs fees, applicable taxes final shop
evaluation charges, insurance fees and any other costs associated, related to the return of an airworthy Core to ALOIA in the
same condition as supplied, regardless of whether Customer returns the Exchange Unit used or unused, and in addtion to
the full Outhright value charges, according to quotation. The Core Unit must be same OEM's PN and will be re-certified back to the same or higher level of condition of the original Exchange Unit.
